tps://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苺、抹茶、チョコ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲームやるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しなーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松葉杖使ったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"火の魔法・水の魔法・雷の魔法"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・風の魔法・この中で１つだけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手に入れられます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴方はどの属性を選びますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風の魔法で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そよ風すきなので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近思ったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの事、呼び捨てなんだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニックネームとか使わないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでかわからんけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は呼び捨てが多いかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私以外でもけっこうみんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼び捨てしてるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はみんな朝から撮影ー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして名古屋ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして大阪ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がががががんばりまりか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-25317":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！\n \n けやき坂46の加藤史帆です！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1R8010A229T34W9VBDG69","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1R91K4QT01AEXR15JQYEN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 昨日はポートメッセ名古屋で6枚目シングルの個別握手会がありました( ・∇・)⭐️\n \n お越し下さった皆さん、ありがとうございました！\n \n 皆さんとお話できてとても楽しかったです🙂\n 最近はダンス練習の日々だったので、皆さんと会えたから今日もまた頑張れそうです！！\n \n 会いに来てくれた皆さんもお仕事とか勉強とかすごく頑張ってて、私も頑張ろうって凄い元気をいただけました！\n 私ばかり元気をもらってるんじゃないかなって心配になるけど、私は皆さんに元気とか幸せとか届けることが出来てますかね？？\n \n 私の存在で、お仕事とか学校頑張ろうって思ってもらえてたら嬉しいなぁ（´-`）.｡oO\n \n 昨日の加藤！！\n \n 2部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RA3FAB0XNREKTDMYAKNB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n お気に入りのトップス(^｡^)\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RBDXTYYC9J23VZGM4Q2N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 全身の写真まともなのがこの写真しかありませんでした🦈\n \n 4部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RCG0C12BGXTSJRPCW32Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n くるりんぱハーフツイン！\n 初期、ライブでよくやっていた髪型！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RDKXFQNTC05AHSW4W4CS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 何をしてる時だろう、、これ、、\n \n 5部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1REMKXB62TJTTXCYX90DT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ポニーテール！低め！\n \n ポニーテールはやっぱり楽ちんで最高ですね〜(^｡^)\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RFRDPCY3EPKFCHMM8N4D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 1部の写真撮り忘れちゃいましたごめんなさい！！\n \n \n 改めて会いに来てくださった皆さん、本当にありがとうございました！\n また会いに来てくれたら嬉しいです( ・∇・)💕\n \n また更新します！\n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"}}